### Update Attachment with Image
POST http://localhost:3001/journalserv/updateAttachment
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachmentID"

019f91d7-9417-7272-b559-0abf8ef43d77
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Updated Attachment Title
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-image.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

